    "aw_faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is ATTARWALAS?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>ATTARWALAS is a Mumbai fragrance house making handcrafted attars and long-lasting perfumes since 1998. You can shop online with delivery across India, or visit our store in Kurla West. <a href=\"/pages/about-us\">Read our story</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you sell alcoholic or non-alcoholic perfumes?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Both. Our <a href=\"/collections/attar-roll-ons\">attar roll-ons</a> are oil-based and alcohol-free, and we also make alcohol-based perfumes. With <a href=\"/products/customize-perfume-1\">Customize Perfume</a> you choose Alcoholic or Non-Alcoholic yourself. Not sure which suits you? <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Ask us</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the difference between attar and perfume?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Attar is a concentrated fragrance oil you roll or dab onto the skin; it sits close and wears for a long time. Perfume is sprayed, so it projects further and covers more area. Our guide to <a href=\"/blogs/news/attar-vs-perfume-difference\">attar vs perfume</a> explains how to choose.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What sizes do your perfumes and attars come in?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><a href=\"/collections/signature-series\">Signature Series</a> perfumes come in 50ml and 100ml, attar roll-ons in 6ml and 12ml, and our <a href=\"/collections/100ml-gift-set\">gift sets</a> in 35ml, 65ml and 100ml.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I choose a scent without smelling it first?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Start with the <a href=\"/products/discovery-set\">Discovery Set</a>, which holds all six Signature scents so you can try them at home. Each product page lists its top, heart and base notes, and our guide on <a href=\"/blogs/news/how-to-choose-your-signature-scent\">finding your signature scent</a> walks you through it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you deliver across India, and how do I track my order?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we deliver across India. Once your order ships you can follow it on our <a href=\"https://attarwalas.shiprocket.co/tracking\">order tracking page</a>. See our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Policy</a> for details.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes a good perfume gift?",
            "icon": "none",
